<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .sub-header {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12pt;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .label {
    font-weight: bold;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 150px; /* Adjust as needed for alignment */
  }
  .input-area {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    min-height: 1em;
  }
  .signature-area {
    margin-top: 80px;
    text-align: right;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <img src="placeholder_logo_1.png" alt="Logo 1" style="height: 60px;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
        <div class="header-title">CENTRE FOR INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS</div>
        <div class="sub-header">ANNA UNIVERSITY, CHENNAI - 600 025.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <img src="placeholder_logo_2.png" alt="Logo 2" style="height: 60px;">
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Application for the Temporary post of IP Analyst</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">(Ref: Advt No: {{ ref_advt_no }} dated {{ ref_date }})</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Applications are invited for the Temporary post of “Intellectual Property (IP) Analyst” at Centre for Intellectual Property Rights (CIPR), Anna University, Chennai - 600 025.</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      1) Name of the post : <span data-field="post_name">{{ post_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      Salary : <span data-field="salary">{{ salary }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      Duration : <span data-field="duration">{{ duration }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      Satisfactory performance with periodical breaks)
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      No. of Post : <span data-field="no_of_post">{{ no_of_post }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      Experience Preferred : <span data-field="experience_preferred">{{ experience_preferred }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      Essential Qualification :
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li><span data-field="essential_qualifications_list">{{ essential_qualifications_list }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      Desirable :
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>(1) Experience in searching through free and paid professional patent databases.</li>
        <li>(2) Experience in patent drafting and other related activities of IPR.</li>
        <li>(3) Knowledge in the Patent Act, 1970</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">
      Eligible Candidates are requested to send their application in the prescribed format given under along with the self attested copies of the Marks & Degree certificates, passport size photograph and copy of address proof, in a closed cover by mentioning “Application for the temporary post of Intellectual Property (IP) Analyst” addressed to The Director, Centre for Intellectual Property Rights (CIPR), CPDE building, Anna University, Chennai 600 025 by post or in person so as to reach on or before {{ application_deadline }}. Candidates short listed for interview will be informed by E-Mail only.</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 10px;">Application received after the last date of submission will be rejected.</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">No TA/DA will be admissible for attending interview.</div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 100px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Director/CIPR</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <div class="section-heading">1. PERSONAL DETAILS</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid black; width: 150px; height: 100px; text-align: center; padding-top: 10px;">
        Photo duly signed by the applicant
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">a. Name: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">b. Date of Birth: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">c. Permanent Address: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">d. Communication Address: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">e. Phone Number: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">f. Mobile Number: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">g. E-Mail: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">h. Nationality: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">i. Patent Agent Certificate Number: <span class="input-area" style="width: 70%;"></span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-heading">2. EDUCATIONAL QUALIFICATION (Starting from SSLC)</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Class/Degree/Certificate</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Specialization</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Year of Passing</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Name of the Institution</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Percentage</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for edu in educational_qualifications %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="educational_qualifications[{{ loop.index0 }}].class_degree">{{ educational_qualifications[loop.index0].class_degree }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="educational_qualifications[{{ loop.index0 }}].specialization">{{ educational_qualifications[loop.index0].specialization }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="educational_qualifications[{{ loop.index0 }}].year_of_passing">{{ educational_qualifications[loop.index0].year_of_passing }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="educational_qualifications[{{ loop.index0 }}].institution_name">{{ educational_qualifications[loop.index0].institution_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="educational_qualifications[{{ loop.index0 }}].percentage">{{ educational_qualifications[loop.index0].percentage }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">3. WORK EXPERIENCE (chronological order)</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Designation</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Period From</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">To</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Organization/Company</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for work in work_experience %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="work_experience[{{ loop.index0 }}].designation">{{ work_experience[loop.index0].designation }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="work_experience[{{ loop.index0 }}].period_from">{{ work_experience[loop.index0].period_from }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="work_experience[{{ loop.index0 }}].period_to">{{ work_experience[loop.index0].period_to }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="work_experience[{{ loop.index0 }}].organization_company">{{ work_experience[loop.index0].organization_company }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    Total Experience (in Years, Months & Days): <span data-field="total_experience">{{ total_experience }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 40px;">4. PATENT DATABASES USED</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 35%;">Name</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Nature Free/Professional</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Year of Experience</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for db in patent_databases_used %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="patent_databases_used[{{ loop.index0 }}].name">{{ patent_databases_used[loop.index0].name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="patent_databases_used[{{ loop.index0 }}].nature">{{ patent_databases_used[loop.index0].nature }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="patent_databases_used[{{ loop.index0 }}].year_of_experience">{{ patent_databases_used[loop.index0].year_of_experience }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-heading">5. PROVIDE THE LIST OF PATENT DRAFTINGS YOU HAVE DONE WHICH ARE PUBLISHED*</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 35%;">Title</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Provisional/Complete Specification</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Publication details</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for patent in patent_draftings %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="patent_draftings[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ patent_draftings[loop.index0].title }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="patent_draftings[{{ loop.index0 }}].specification_type">{{ patent_draftings[loop.index0].specification_type }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="patent_draftings[{{ loop.index0 }}].publication_details">{{ patent_draftings[loop.index0].publication_details }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">*Use Additional Sheet, if necessary.</div>

  <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 40px;">6. ANY OTHER SPECIAL MENTION YOU WANTED TO MAKE</div>
  <div style="border: 1px solid black; height: 150px; margin-top: 10px;">
    <span class="input-area" style="height: 100%;"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 40px;">7. LIST OF ENCLOSURES</div>
  <ol style="padding-left: 20px;">
    <li><span data-field="enclosures[{{ 0 }}]">{{ enclosures[0] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="enclosures[{{ 1 }}]">{{ enclosures[1] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="enclosures[{{ 2 }}]">{{ enclosures[2] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="enclosures[{{ 3 }}]">{{ enclosures[3] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="enclosures[{{ 4 }}]">{{ enclosures[4] }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="enclosures[{{ 5 }}]">{{ enclosures[5] }}</span></li>
  </ol>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">I, <span data-field="applicant_name_declaration">{{ applicant_name_declaration }}</span>, certify that the information furnished above is true to the best of my knowledge and belief and that no related information is concealed. If any discrepancy is found at any stage, the Director, CIPR has the right to cancel my selection/candidature.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 100px;">
    <div>
      Place: <span data-field="place_of_application">{{ place_of_application }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      SIGNATURE
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 10pt;">Date: <span data-field="date_of_application">{{ date_of_application }}</span></div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center;">
    PS: Do not enclose the original certificates. Attach only the attested copies. During the time of the personnel interview you need to show the original certificates for verification.
  </div>
</div>